# UI design system

Canonical tokens: `@tailwind.config.ts`. Shared utilities: `@src/app/globals.css`. Shell spacing: `@src/app/layout.tsx`.

## Color and type

- Prefer semantic Tailwind colors from the theme (`primary`, `on-surface`, `on-surface-variant`, `surface-container-*`, `outline-variant`, `error`, `tertiary`) over raw hex
- Brand cyan `#00D2FF` is used for active nav and a few map/search accents; do not replace the theme `primary` (`#37bcf7`) with it globally
- Headings: `font-headline` (Manrope), usually `font-bold` / `font-extrabold` / `font-black` with `tracking-tight`
- Body: `font-body`. Micro labels: `font-label`, often `text-[10px]` or `text-xs` plus `uppercase tracking-widest`

## Surfaces

- Frosted panels: `glass-card` plus large radii (`rounded-xl`, `rounded-2xl`, `rounded-3xl`) and a light `border-outline-variant/10` or `/20`
- Decorative glows: large blurred `bg-primary/20` (or tertiary) orbs, not extra CSS files
- Horizontal scrollers: `hide-scrollbar` (dashboard) or `no-scrollbar` if already used on that page — do not invent a third utility
- Progress/meter bars: `h-1.5` track on `bg-surface-container-highest` or `bg-surface-container-low`, fill with `bg-primary` or `from-primary to-primary-container`

## Icons

```tsx
<span className="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="cloud">cloud</span>
```

- Filled (active weather, play, selected nav): `style={{ fontVariationSettings: "'FILL' 1" }}`
- Do not add lucide, heroicons, or SVG icon packs

## Layout offsets

The chrome is fixed. Content must clear it:

- Standard pages: `pt-24 px-4 md:px-8` (TopBar is `h-16`)
- Full-bleed maps: `mt-16 h-[calc(100vh-64px)]` overlay UI, not the padded page template
- Main already has `md:ml-[280px]` and `pb-20 md:pb-0` for the mobile bottom nav — do not duplicate the sidebar offset inside pages

## Motion and controls

- Hover: modest `transition-colors` / `hover:scale-105` / `hover:translate-x-1` — no new animation libraries
- Primary actions: `bg-primary text-on-primary` (or brand cyan on maps search)
- Destructive / immediate alerts: `error` tokens and a `border-l-4 border-error`
- Warning / expected: `tertiary` tokens
